  "details": "There are 4 badges in VRChat:\n\n- Early Supporter Badge\n\n- VRChat+ Supporter Badge\n\n- VRChat Team Alumni Badge\n\n- VRChat Translator Badge\n\nBut the UI can't show 4th badges because the space isn't enough.\n\nAlthough users with four badges do not yet exist, the possibility has been created for more than four badges to appear in the UI. So the UI needs to improve.\n\nI suggest the badge can be detachable like languages area or links area.\n\nI also figured add a \"view all\" button like the groups area.",
